0..67 Comment "// A role states what it needs of the site that hosts it, as a row."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..144 Comment "// The requirement travels with the program, and the offer stays with the"
145..220 Comment "// site. A deployment that pairs them wrongly is refused before any process"
221..231 Comment "// starts."
232..234 Comment "//"
235..304 Comment "// `far` requires the console, and a store of strings under the label"
305..380 Comment "// `store`. A site hosting `far` must grant the console and bind a model of"
381..456 Comment "// `Store` at `V = String` to `store`. `gandr check` of the manifold judges"
457..510 Comment "// each entry of the row against the site\'s `offers`."
511..513 Comment "//"
514..574 Comment "// - see: `offers.site.gandr` — the site answering the row"
575..645 Comment "// - see: `offers.manifold.gandr` — the manifold placing `far` there"
646..724 Comment "// - see: `corpus/pathological/worlds/offers.gandr` — sites leaving an entry"
725..771 Comment "//   unanswered, and a world the program lacks"
